"""Idea Foundry: a local idea-to-app workbench."""

__version__ = "0.33.0"

__release_notes__ = "Scope-first planning and Test → Diag: new guided/proof drafts save scope separately, request acceptance evidence against its stable feature indexes, then compile small tasks before ordinary full-proposal approval. Specific validation codes and multiple failure paths replace generic outline errors. Test runs bounded storage/controller/catalogue checks; optional local or explicitly consented cloud probes send only a fixed tiny JSON fixture. Results persist into Diag without executing generated code, changing saved routes or influencing cooldowns. Continuous local runtime snapshots and Diag capture loaded model context/VRAM metadata, Ollama version and requested JSON response mode; unknowns remain explicit. Existing projects, frozen checks, consent and updater rollback are preserved. Fixtures do not establish live model quality or restore exhausted quotas."
